<title>SPAIN: Gas Natural to invest 20 bln pta in network.</title>
<headline>Gas Natural to invest 20 bln pta in network.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's Gas Natural will invest almost 20 billion pesetas to complete its natural gas network in the Castilla-La Mancha region, the company said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The company said it had already invested 22.4 billion pesetas on developing its network in the region.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom + 34 1 585 2161</p>
</text>
